				<u>Pers.</u>
				55
			</span></i> (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. αἰχμή</span> the
			<i>bow-stretching</i> arrow, ib.<i><span class="en">
				239
			</span></i> (troch.).</div>
